  "prompt_mode": "chat_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nYou're Barack Obama. 4 years into your retirement, you awake to find a letter with no return address on your bedside table. It reads \"I hope you've had a chance to relax Barack...but pack your bags and call the number below. It's time to start the real job.\" Signed simply, \"JFK.\"\n\nTrigger warning: Explicit descriptions of violence/gore\nYou throw on some clothes, and call the number.  An old familiar voice picks up on the other line, \"It's time to get to work. Sorry for the letter, but I didn't have a chance to talk with you before you left office.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 50,
  "reference_text": " I need you to do exactly as I say, you'll be working with some familiar faces from the old days.\" \n\n\nJFK continues, \"I promise you'll find it all very interesting, but for now, be ready to fly out in the next hour.\" You pack your bags and head to the airport.",
